style:normal;\" lang=\"es\">Anzejs Pasecniks, nuevo jugador del Coosur Real Betis</cite></a>&#160;\u00bb, sur <span class=\"italique\">realbetisbalompie.es</span>, <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2021-11\" data-sort-value=\"2021-11\">novembre 2021</time> <small style=\"line-height:1em;\">(consult\u00e9 le <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2021-11-21\" data-sort-value=\"2021-11-21\">21 novembre 2021</time>)</small></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-8\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-8\">\u2191</a> </span><span class=\"reference-text\"><span class=\"ouvrage\">\u00ab&#160;<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.lequipe.fr/Basket/Actualites/Anzejs-pasecniks-rejoint-boulogne-levallois-comme-pigiste-medical/1367699\"><cite style=\"font-style:normal;\">Anzejs Pasecniks rejoint Boulogne-Levallois comme pigiste m\u00e9dical</cite></a>&#160;\u00bb, L'\u00c9quipe, <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2022-11-30\" data-sort-value=\"2022-11-30\">30 novembre 2022</time></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-9\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-9\">\u2191</a> </span><span class=\"reference-text\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.bebasket.fr/les-metropolitans-92-officialisent-le-depart-danzejs-pasecniks/\">https://www.bebasket.fr/les-metropolitans-92-officialisent-le-depart-danzejs-pasecniks/</a></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-10\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-10\">\u2191</a> </span><span class=\"reference-text\"><span class=\"ouvrage\"><abbr class=\"abbr indicateur-langue\" title=\"Langue : anglais\">(en)</abbr> \u00ab&#160;<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://sportando.basketball/en/anzejs-pasecniks-returns-to-real-betis/\"><cite style=\"font-style:normal;\" lang=\"en\">Anzejs Pasecniks returns to Real Betis</cite></a>&#160;\u00bb, sur <span class=\"italique\">Sportando</span>, <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2023-0